OL,5,G0600 James Martin's American Adventure
OL,6,     FThe chef makes a high-octane pit
OL,7,     Fstop at the world-famous Sonoma
OL,8,     FRaceway. Nestled in amongst
OL,9,     FSonoma's vineyards, James
OL,10,     Fdiscovers the preparations for the
OL,11,     FIndyCar season finale and gets
OL,12,     Fdriven around the track by
OL,13,     FAmerican motorsport hero Mario
OL,14,     FAndretti. James cooks trackside
OL,15,     Fbefore visiting a new foodie
OL,16,     FSonoma hotspot, simply called
OL,17,     FShed. After a wholesome lunch made
OL,18,     Fwith only the best local
OL,19,     Fingredients, James gets invited to
OL,20,     FMario's nearby vineyard for a
OL,21,     Fglass of wine and to discuss the
OL,22,     Fthrills and spills of motorsport
