OL,5,G1310 Force of Nature
OL,6,     FAndrew Lincoln narrates a look at
OL,7,     Fanimals' battle for survival as
OL,8,     Fclimate change intensifies and the
OL,9,     Fweather becomes more extreme. An
OL,10,     Fowl on the American prairies uses
OL,11,     Fits extraordinary hearing and
OL,12,     Funderground burrows to save its
OL,13,     Fchicks, while two cheetahs in
OL,14,     FKenya face record-breaking floods,
OL,15,     Fand a polar bear loses the summer
OL,16,     Fsea ice it relies on
